#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:2
msgid "开发指南"
msgstr "Development Guide"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:4
msgid "只修改文档时，先运行中英文严格构建与图片引用检查；修改行为时，再运行对应 SDK、扩展或前端检查。具体步骤如下。"
msgstr ""
"For documentation-only changes, run strict builds in both languages and check image "
"references. For behavior changes, run the relevant SDK, extension or frontend checks "
"below."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:6
msgid ""
"本指南面向 AgentSociety 2 的贡献者。仓库中的开发约定以 `CONTRIBUTING.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-"
"fib-lab/agentsociety/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_ 为准。"
msgstr ""
"This guide is for AgentSociety 2 contributors. Repository development conventions are"
" maintained in `CONTRIBUTING.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-"
"lab/agentsociety/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:9
msgid "设置开发环境"
msgstr "Setting Up Development Environment"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:11
msgid "在仓库根目录安装 SDK 的开发与文档依赖："
msgstr "Install SDK development and documentation dependencies from the repository root:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:13
msgid ""
"uv sync\n"
"cd packages/agentsociety2\n"
"uv sync --extra dev --extra docs"
msgstr ""
"uv sync\n"
"cd packages/agentsociety2\n"
"uv sync --extra dev --extra docs"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:20
msgid "运行测试与检查"
msgstr "Run Tests and Checks"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:22
msgid "在 ``packages/agentsociety2/`` 下执行："
msgstr "Run in ``packages/agentsociety2/``:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:24
msgid ""
"MEM0_TELEMETRY=False ANONYMIZED_TELEMETRY=False uv run pytest\n"
"uv run ruff check .\n"
"uv run ruff format --check ."
msgstr ""
"MEM0_TELEMETRY=False ANONYMIZED_TELEMETRY=False uv run pytest\n"
"uv run ruff check .\n"
"uv run ruff format --check ."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:30
msgid "扩展与前端的安装、检查及构建分别在各自目录运行："
msgstr "Install, check and build the extension and frontend in their respective directories:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:32
msgid ""
"# From the repository root\n"
"cd extension\n"
"npm ci\n"
"npm run check\n"
"\n"
"cd ../frontend\n"
"npm ci\n"
"npm run lint\n"
"npm run build"
msgstr ""
"# From the repository root\n"
"cd extension\n"
"npm ci\n"
"npm run check\n"
"\n"
"cd ../frontend\n"
"npm ci\n"
"npm run lint\n"
"npm run build"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:44
msgid ""
"扩展开发与截图说明见 `extension/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-"
"lab/agentsociety/blob/main/extension/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md>`_；网页截图与浏览器回归说明见 "
"`frontend/README.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-"
"lab/agentsociety/blob/main/frontend/README.md>`_。"
msgstr ""
"See `extension/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-"
"lab/agentsociety/blob/main/extension/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md>`_ for extension development"
" and screenshots, and `frontend/README.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-"
"lab/agentsociety/blob/main/frontend/README.md>`_ for webpage captures and browser "
"regressions."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:47
msgid "启动后端"
msgstr "Start the Backend"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:49
msgid "uv run python -m agentsociety2.backend.run"
msgstr "uv run python -m agentsociety2.backend.run"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:53
msgid ""
"默认监听 ``127.0.0.1:8001``，运行中的 API 文档位于 ``/docs``。HTTP 接口与调试示例见 :doc:`api/http`，后端模块与请求模型的 Python "
"接口见 :doc:`api/backend`。"
msgstr ""
"The backend listens on ``127.0.0.1:8001`` by default, with live API documentation at ``/docs``. "
"See :doc:`api/http` for HTTP access and debugging examples, and :doc:`api/backend` for the Python"
" interfaces of backend modules and request models."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:56
msgid "构建文档"
msgstr "Build Documentation"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:58
msgid "在 ``packages/agentsociety2/docs/`` 下执行："
msgstr "Run in ``packages/agentsociety2/docs/``:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:60
msgid ""
"make html-zh SPHINXOPTS=\"-W --keep-going\"\n"
"make html-en SPHINXOPTS=\"-W --keep-going\""
msgstr ""
"make html-zh SPHINXOPTS=\"-W --keep-going\"\n"
"make html-en SPHINXOPTS=\"-W --keep-going\""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:65
msgid ""
"输出分别位于 ``_build/html/zh/`` 与 ``_build/html/en/``。修改正文后，使用 ``make update-po`` "
"更新英文目录，完成翻译后再执行 ``make html-en``。"
msgstr ""
"Output is written to ``_build/html/zh/`` and ``_build/html/en/``. After editing "
"source text, run ``make update-po`` to update English catalogs, translate new "
"messages, then run ``make html-en``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:68
msgid "结构与扩展入口"
msgstr "Architecture and Extension Points"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:70
msgid ":doc:`architecture`：运行时架构、执行与恢复。"
msgstr ":doc:`architecture`: runtime architecture, execution and recovery."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:71
msgid ":doc:`custom_modules`：新增智能体与环境模块。"
msgstr ":doc:`custom_modules`: add agents and environment modules."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:72
msgid ":doc:`module_and_parameter_management`：模块发现与预填充参数。"
msgstr ":doc:`module_and_parameter_management`: module discovery and prefill parameters."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:73
msgid ":doc:`agent_skills`：技能运行时契约。"
msgstr ":doc:`agent_skills`: skill runtime contracts."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:74
msgid ":doc:`contributing`：报告问题与提交更改。"
msgstr ":doc:`contributing`: report issues and submit changes."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:77
msgid "发布流程"
msgstr "Release Process"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:79
msgid ""
"版本号、变更日志、标签与发布检查统一遵循仓库 `CONTRIBUTING.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-"
"lab/agentsociety/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_，避免各处文档维护不同的发布步骤。"
msgstr ""
"Follow repository `CONTRIBUTING.md <https://github.com/tsinghua-fib-"
"lab/agentsociety/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`_ for versions, changelogs, tags and "
"release checks, avoiding conflicting release instructions across documents."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:82
msgid "规范参考"
msgstr "Standards and references"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:84
msgid "`Semantic Versioning <https://semver.org/>`_：版本号含义；本项目的组件版本与发布标签以仓库贡献指南为准。"
msgstr ""
"`Semantic Versioning <https://semver.org/>`_: Version-number semantics. Component versions and "
"release tags follow the repository contribution guide."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:85
msgid "`Conventional Commits <https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/>`_：提交类型与标题格式。"
msgstr ""
"`Conventional Commits <https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/>`_: Commit types and "
"subject format."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:86
msgid ""
"`reStructuredText 标记入门 <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/restructuredtext/basics.html>`_：内联代码、加粗与列表的写法。"
msgstr ""
"`reStructuredText primer <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/restructuredtext/basics.html>`_: Inline code, emphasis, and list syntax."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:68
msgid "实时预览与翻译检查"
msgstr "Live preview and translation checks"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:70
msgid "文档依赖已包含实时预览工具。从仓库根目录启动，修改正文、示例或 Python 文档字符串后，浏览器会自动刷新："
msgstr ""
"The documentation dependencies include a live-preview tool. Start it from the repository root; "
"the browser refreshes after changes to documentation, examples or Python docstrings:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:72
msgid ""
"make docs-live\n"
"# English preview, using a separate port\n"
"make docs-live DOCS_LANGUAGE=en DOCS_PORT=8002"
msgstr ""
"make docs-live\n"
"# English preview, using a separate port\n"
"make docs-live DOCS_LANGUAGE=en DOCS_PORT=8002"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:78
msgid ""
"默认中文预览地址是 ``http://127.0.0.1:8000``，仅监听本机。预览输出在 ``docs-preview/zh/`` 或 ``docs-"
"preview/en/``；英文预览使用已维护的翻译目录，不会自动翻译新增文字。"
msgstr ""
"The Chinese preview defaults to ``http://127.0.0.1:8000`` and listens on the local machine only. "
"Output is written to ``docs-preview/zh/`` or ``docs-preview/en/``. The English preview uses the "
"maintained catalogs and does not translate new content automatically."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/development.rst:80
msgid ""
"提交前执行 ``make ci-docs-build`` 与 ``make ci-docs-"
"browser``，分别检查中英文构建、翻译、真实离线脚本和页面交互。翻译目录中的缺失、模糊和未使用条目都会报错。需要测试网络或模型的示例应另外验收，不加入普通文档构建。"
msgstr ""
"Before committing, run ``make ci-docs-build`` and ``make ci-docs-browser`` to check bilingual "
"builds, translations, real offline scripts and page interactions. Missing, fuzzy or unused active"
" translations fail the checks. Examples requiring network access or models need separate "
"validation and are excluded from ordinary documentation builds."
